/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:173:    """
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:174:    Greedily select non-overlapping black squares, then recolor and corner-mark them by adjacency degree.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:175:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:176:    Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:177:    - A black background contains grey obstacle pixels that block candidate square regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:178:    - Any all-black axis-aligned square of side >= 2 is a candidate; candidates may overlap.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:179:    - The same open black region can therefore support several competing square candidates of different sizes or offsets.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:180:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:181:    Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:182:    - Enumerate every all-black square, sort by side length descending, then by top-left row and column ascending.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:183:    - Traverse that order greedily and keep a square iff it has no pixel overlap with any already selected square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:184:    - Fill every selected square blue, compute which selected squares are adjacent by boundary 8-neighborhood, and use that degree:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:185:      degree 0 keeps blue and gets red outside-corner marks on all four corners;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:186:      degree 1 keeps blue and gets red marks only on the two corners closest to its unique neighbor's center;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:187:      degree >= 2 is recolored yellow and gets no marks.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/opus/3/003/5.py:188:    - Red marks are painted only onto in-bounds black background pixels; grey obstacles remain unchanged.
